                                        </div>
                                        <h2 class="ref-orig-head" data-mc-autonum="Originated in version"><span class="autonumber"><span>Originated in version</span></span>&#160;</h2>
                                        <p class="or-origin">20.1</p>
                                        <h2 class="ref-desc-head" data-mc-autonum="Description"><span class="autonumber"><span>Description</span></span>&#160;</h2>
                                        <p>Automate triggering a Claris Connect flow using a Claris Connect webhook. For information about Claris Connect flows, webhooks, AppIDs, and APIKeys, see <a href="https://www.claris.com/redirects/connect_admin.html?page=help&amp;lang=en" target="_blank">Claris Connect Help</a>.</p>
                                        <h2 class="notes-head" data-mc-autonum="Notes"><span class="autonumber"><span>Notes</span></span>&#160;</h2>
                                        <ul>
                                            <li>
                                                <p>If the flow is inactive, this script step sends data to the flow''s trigger but doesn''t cause the flow to run. You can use this behavior to test your script while the flow is inactive and to confirm that the flow''s trigger is receiving data from your script before you enable the flow in Claris&#160;Connect.</p>
                                            </li>
                                        </ul>
                                        <h2 class="ref-example1-head" data-mc-autonum="Example 1"><span class="autonumber"><span>Example 1</span></span>&#160;</h2>
                                        <p>Triggers the "ExampleFlow" flow which uses the "webhook.example.com" webhook, providing JSON data, then setting the "SampleTableName:SampleFieldName" field with the result from the interaction.</p>
                                        <div class="codeSnippet"><a class="codeSnippetCopyButton" role="button" href="javascript:void(0);">Copy</a>
                                            <div class="codeSnippetBody" data-mc-use-line-numbers="False" data-mc-line-number-start="1" data-mc-continue="False"><pre><code>Trigger Claris Connect Flow [ Flow: "ExampleFlow" ; URL: "https://webhook.example.com/" ; JSON Data: JSONSetElement ( "" ; "abc" ; "xyz" ; JSONString ) ; Target: SampleTableName:SampleFieldName ]</code></pre>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
